1327
01:55:40,000 --> 01:55:41,440
¡Espera!

1328
01:56:22,840 --> 01:56:25,440
Puedo ver esa cosa roja para mamá.

1329
01:56:25,600 --> 01:56:27,680
Mira esa blusa roja.

1330
01:56:27,840 --> 01:56:29,040
Blusa roja.

1331
01:56:36,760 --> 01:56:37,760
